		{"id":"193dce264222b80c","type":"text","text":"This is the exact kind of jazz fusion I need. (Ofc I wanna reference CASSIOPEA but this is another style to look at)","x":-3120,"y":-2991,"width":250,"height":168},
		{"id":"69f060b4811af31d","type":"text","text":"ik this is a trans allegory but the idea of killing your siblings is also still true for the Hiue sibs","x":-1850,"y":-3761,"width":250,"height":140},
